<title>USA: MedCath buys California company.</title>
<headline>MedCath buys California company.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, N.C. 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>MedCath Inc said Friday it had bought Ultimed Inc, which provides cardiovascular disease management services to health organizations in Los Angeles.</p>
<p>MedCath, which did not disclose the terms of the deal, said the acquired company will enable it to get contracts with health management organizations to provide cardiovascular care for their members.</p>
<p>MedCath provides cardiology and cardiovascular services.</p>
</text>
